## Prepare the v0.8.2 release
================================================================================

Context:
Release v0.8.2 with the fixes merged after the 13 October release notes: the
Knowledge Graph build fix (#201) and table descriptions (section above).

Changes:

1. releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.8.2.md
   Added the Knowledge Graph build and table-description fixes (highlights, two sections, upgrade notes, bug fixes) and replaced the test-status line with the full-suite result.
2. uv.lock
   Root package version 0.8.1 → 0.8.2, matching pyproject.toml (one line). A re-lock was not possible from this network: pypi.org is not reachable directly, and `uv lock` through the internal index rewrites every URL to `pypi-proxy.cloud.databricks.com`, which must not be committed (see `.cursor/09-package-management.mdc`).

Modified files:
- releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.8.2.md
- uv.lock
- changelogs/v0.8.2/dermotsmyth-db_2026-10-21.log

Tests: no code change; same full-suite run as the section above (5939 passed, 0 failed).

================================================================================
## Address Isaac Review comments on PR #202
================================================================================

Context:
Isaac Review (`isaac review --base origin/0.8.2`) posted no findings. Of the
comments it filtered below its auto-post threshold, three were worth acting on:
two test gaps and a docstring that overclaimed. The others were pre-existing
behaviour (validation outside the try, one request and one logged error per
table) or speculative (non-dict response body), and the `has_valid_auth`
concern does not apply: `DatabricksAuth` reads DATABRICKS_TOKEN at init.

Changes:

1. tests/units/core/test_unity_catalog.py
   New tests: no request is sent without credentials or without a host (the guard was untested). The "no comment" and "API refuses" tests now also check the tables API was called, so they no longer pass on the old SQL path. Mutation-checked: removing the guard, or skipping the API call, fails these tests.
2. src/back/core/databricks/uc/UnityCatalog.py
   Docstring: `get_table_comment()` returns "" when the table has no comment or the call fails; invalid identifiers still raise ValidationError.
3. releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.8.2.md
   Test count updated.

Modified files:
- tests/units/core/test_unity_catalog.py
- src/back/core/databricks/uc/UnityCatalog.py
- releases/ReleaseNotes_V0.8.2.md
- changelogs/v0.8.2/dermotsmyth-db_2026-10-21.log

Tests: `uv run --frozen pytest -q -m "not scenario"` → 5941 passed, 316 skipped, 9 deselected, 0 failed in 35.12s (same 9 deselected as above).
